===============================================================================
Protocol
===============================================================================

The BLE protocol implemented here is specified in the sibling repository
`p2pgps-protocol` (`spec/protocol-v1.md`), mirrored at
`p2pgps/docs/protocol-spec.md` at the time of writing. The specification and
the Python reference implementation are MIT licensed; this app is a separate
AGPL-3.0 work.

===============================================================================
Security note
===============================================================================

This app does not collect, transmit or store location data off-device. It does
not include Apple ID credentials, certificates, provisioning profiles or
pairing files. Pairing files imported by the user are stored only in the app's
Application Support directory (Pairing/) with 0600 permissions, Data Protection
(iOS), and the "excluded from backup" flag; Documents copies created by older
builds or by the document picker are deleted after import, and the file is never
logged.
